{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/323","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/323/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/323/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/323/events","html_url":"https://github.com/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/323","id":6025111454,"node_id":"I_kwDOVFVR088AAAABZx_nng","number":323,"title":"[消息队列 MQ15] Kafka 多副本确认：写入成功，到底哪些副本已经跟上？","user":{"login":"linhongcun","id":230383104,"node_id":"U_kgDODbteAA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230383104?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun","html_url":"https://github.com/linhongcun","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-25T13:44:42Z","updated_at":"2026-10-28T05:08:17Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!-- message-queue-series:2026-10-25:mq15 -->\n\n**核心顺序9/9；MQ15保留为稳定题库索引，不改编成新MQ号。待定稿，未开拍。** 拟为独立视频及配套图文，无观看硬前置。\n\n## 独立问题与主线\n\n本系列统一Kafka。MQ04讲生产者能观察到哪些发送结果；本片沿各副本的实际记录与ISR变化，解释同一成功结果背后的数据保护条件和可用性取舍。\n\n同样有三个副本，生产者收到成功后，为什么一种配置仍有更高丢失风险，另一种又可能拒绝继续写入？\n\n1. 本片自行建立一个Kafka数据分区的Leader、Follower、复制进度与ISR；沿同一条记录显示“已到Leader”与“已复制”是不同状态。\n2. 从相同初始状态对照acks=1与acks=all；固定min.insync.replicas=2，明确关闭ELR与unclean选主；all等待当前ISR的确认，在all分支minISR是写入成功所需的ISR数量下限。\n3. 让副本落后、退出ISR或让Leader故障，追踪哪些副本实际已有已确认记录，以及何时应拒绝写入；用可用性与数据风险收束。\n\n观众应能读懂确认到底证明了哪一步。本片聚焦复制确认的故障边界，不塞入KRaft投票、完整分区选举或跨机房容灾。\n\n## 专项对照验收\n\n在固定版本与配置下核对每个副本的记录、ISR变化和生产者返回：正常复制时all的等待范围；acks=all分支中ISR不足minISR时不能冒充成功；确认前后注入单Broker故障时，分别查明已确认记录的实际存留。不同acks分支先重置，不能只用在线图标代替复制证据。\n\n## 边界与资料\n\nacks=all不等于等待集群所有机器，也不等于只等够minISR个副本就返回。复制确认不自动代表各副本已刷入稳定介质，更不代表消费业务完成。明确教学基线不代表当前所有集群的默认配置，固定ISR/ELR及unclean相关配置，单条消息对照显式关闭生产幂等以隔离acks差异；接管资格受它们约束，不能承诺任意故障均无丢失。数据分区复制不画成分区副本互跑KRaft投票；控制器选举与分区接管继续由原专题另讲。\n\n- [Kafka 4.4 Producer Configs](https://kafka.apache.org/44/configuration/producer-configs/)：acks的确认范围。\n- [Kafka 4.4 Topic Configs](https://kafka.apache.org/44/configuration/topic-configs/#min.insync.replicas)：min.insync.replicas等条件。\n- [Kafka 4.4 Eligible Leader Replicas](https://kafka.apache.org/44/operations/eligible-leader-replicas/)：故障后的接管边界。\n\n公共制作与验收规范统一见[总览#308](https://github.com/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/308)；模型推演与真实Kafka故障结果分别记录。\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/323/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/323/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://